&lt;h2 id="introduction">Introduction&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>On &lt;strong>December 17, 2025&lt;/strong>, I proudly &lt;strong>defended my MSc thesis&lt;/strong>:&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>&amp;ldquo;Advanced Machine Learning Techniques and Explainable AI for Financial Fraud Detection&amp;rdquo;&lt;/strong>&lt;br>
at the &lt;strong>Warsaw University of Technology, Poland&lt;/strong>.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>This thesis focused on developing &lt;strong>robust, interpretable, and reproducible ML pipelines&lt;/strong> to detect and prevent financial fraud. It emphasized &lt;strong>Explainable AI (XAI)&lt;/strong> techniques such as &lt;strong>SHAP&lt;/strong> and &lt;strong>LIME&lt;/strong> to provide actionable insights for decision-makers. The work addressed real-world challenges, including &lt;strong>highly imbalanced datasets&lt;/strong>, noisy financial records, and complex sequential patterns.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="thesis-highlights">Thesis Highlights&lt;/h2>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>Designed &lt;strong>end-to-end ML pipelines&lt;/strong> for preprocessing, feature engineering, model training, evaluation, and explainability.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Applied &lt;strong>SHAP and LIME&lt;/strong> for transparent, interpretable model predictions.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Ensured &lt;strong>robustness, reproducibility, and reliability&lt;/strong> for real-world financial applications.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Delivered &lt;strong>actionable insights&lt;/strong> to improve auditing, decision-making, and fraud mitigation.&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h2 id="defense--graduation">Defense &amp;amp; Graduation&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>The defense included:&lt;/p>
&lt;ol>
&lt;li>A &lt;strong>comprehensive presentation&lt;/strong> of methodology, results, and insights to faculty and peers.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>A live &lt;strong>demonstration of ML pipelines and explainable predictions&lt;/strong>.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>In-depth discussions on &lt;strong>ethical AI, fairness, and practical deployment considerations&lt;/strong>.&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;p>I am honored to have graduated with &lt;strong>Excellent Rank (highest grade)&lt;/strong>, reflecting both my &lt;strong>academic excellence&lt;/strong> and the &lt;strong>impact of my research&lt;/strong>.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="reflections">Reflections&lt;/h2>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>The MSc journey strengthened my &lt;strong>expertise in Graph Neural Networks, NLP, LLMs, and predictive modeling&lt;/strong>.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>It reinforced the importance of &lt;strong>robust evaluation, reproducibility, and explainability&lt;/strong> in AI systems.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Excited to apply these skills to &lt;strong>AI-driven research, industry projects, and socially impactful solutions&lt;/strong>.&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
